<title>UK: ING Baring leads 125 mln Dfl Venezuela-linked bond. [CORRECTED 16:05 GMT]</title>
<headline>ING Baring leads 125 mln Dfl Venezuela-linked bond. [CORRECTED 16:05 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p>BORROWER  VENEZUELA SYNTHETIC SOVEREIGN INVESTMENT (JERSEY) LTD</p>
<p> AMT    125 MLN DFL   COUPON     9.0	 MATURITY    28.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.0     PAY DATE  L-03.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.5	 REOFFER    100.0     SPREAD	+410 BP</p>
<p>(Corrects full fees figure from 2.0 to 2.5.)</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-1M   GOV LAW    ENGLISH</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.0	 SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND REPUBLIC OF VENEZUELA DCB DUE DEC 2007</p>
<p>			    SERIES DL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
